# Force LF on checkout on every OS: the arm YAMLs, split JSONs, digests and manifests are hashed, and a
# CRLF conversion on Windows would change every digest (git's core.autocrlf is overridden by this file).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf
*.tex text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
# binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.parquet binary
*.pt binary
*.pdf binary
